  "name": "muchin-clean",
  "description": "Muchin is a modular Rust framework for constructing complex, interacting state machines via composable logic units termed models. It enforces a strict boundary between side-effect-free pure state transitions and isolated effectful models, utilizing an action-driven dispatcher to synchronize communications. The architecture supports deterministic execution through unique identifier (UID) generation and provides built-in facilities for session recording and bit-perfect replay.",
